It's... showtime!

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:36.610
Blossom!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.070
Take this!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.620
Oh? You've gotten stronger, haven't you?

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.540
No more playing around!

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.540
Just what I wanted!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.610
I'll show you the Marine Tact's power!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:00.640
I did it!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:03.470
The Blessed Perfume of Red Light!

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:08.160
A spray makes my mood speed up!

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:14.610
It looks like I can finally stop holding back!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:22.780
Blossom Full-Body Punch!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.380
Damn you!

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.800
Shtop bullying Sunshine!

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:44.260
Potpourri, don't show yourself like that!

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:47.270
You have to believe in your partner!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:51.560
Sunshine! You can do it! I'm shure you can!

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:54.940
Thank you, Potpourri...

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:56.780
I'll be all right.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:12.580
No matter how much you try to get in our way, you
 can't stop us turning this world into a barren desert!

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:16.810
You have a most malevolent darkness within you.

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:19.200
And that darkness in your heart...

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:23.550
shall be illuminated by my light!

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.770
Gather, Floral Power!

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:40.210
Shiny Tambourine!

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:56.500
Flowers, dance for me!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:03.210
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:23.170
Stop her!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.790
Sasorina!

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:36.180
This is bad!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.260
You wretched Precure!

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:40.830
We'll have to settle this another time!

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:54.480
Have you all finished drawing?

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:56.610
How about this?

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:58.380
It's not bad, but...

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:02.460
I'm sure you can find a design that can bring out a new side of you.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:06.450
Somehow, it's kinda ended up looking the same as all my other stuff...

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:11.040
I wonder what kind of dress a new me would want to wear?

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:16.040
You just have to find a design that excites you!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.960
That excites me?

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:21.590
Finished!

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:23.760
Whoa, that's amazing! You did all these?

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:30.260
Because I met you all and had such fun together with you,

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:33.680
just thinking about it fills my head with all these brilliant ideas!

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:37.940
All right then!

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:41.640
We should work hard too, so Itsuki doesn't show us all up!

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:42.900
Right!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.980
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:32.650
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.980
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.400
All those

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:08.990
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:14.240
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:16.910
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:21.120
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:27.260
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:31.300
With all our might!

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:34.640
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.810
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:44.970
<i>Our summer camp isn't over yet! {Next ep or the ep after next, can we stick a 1 2 3 in the ED karaoke over each of Coupe's appearances, and then put a total at the end? I figure we want at least one or two pristine showings before we start fucking with it.}</i>

00:23:44.970 --> 00:23:48.490
<i>I sense a girl whose heart is being 
torn apart by her subtle emotions!</i>

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:50.950
<i>She wants to become friends
 with the girl she admires most...</i>

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:52.520
<i>...but all she can do is sigh wistfully!</i>

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:54.950
<i>Well, she should just say "Hey, be my friend!"</i>

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:55.780
<i>Yeah, she should.</i>

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:57.490
<i>She's suffering because she can't work up the courage!</i>

00:23:57.490 --> 00:23:59.580
<i>You can be so dense, Itsuki!</i>

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:00.500
<i>Huh? I can?</i>

00:24:01.250 --> 00:24:03.040
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:06.040
Be Brave<i>!</i>

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:06.040
Be Brave<i>!</i>

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:08.420
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
